    "body": "## Description\n\nWould it be possible to add support for **OpenCode v2** alongside Claude Code, Codex CLI, and Gemini CLI?\n\n## Requested Features\n\n- Support OpenCode v2 in `tour setup`.\n- Support tour generation and follow-up questions using `opencode run` with OpenCode v2.\n- Maintain the same read-only behavior and security restrictions as existing integrations.\n\nOpenCode v2 supports multiple model providers, making diff-tour more accessible to users with different AI setups.\n\nReference: https://opencode.ai/docs/cli/",
